' --- System actor ---
UC001 ..> system : <<send confirmation e-mail>>
UC080 ..> UC084 : <<include>>
UC085 ..> UC072 : <<include>>
UC086 ..> UC080 : <<extend>>
UC082 ..> UC081 : <<include>>
UC024 ..> UC012 : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC084
  System computes points from
  IAAF coefficients (a, b, c) and
  the result string of the event.
end note

note right of UC072
  System matches the athlete
  to a category by gender
  and year of birth.
end note

UC074 ..> UC072 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC074
  Registrations arrive as an .xlsx file.
  Known athletes are reused, unknown ones
  are created without a club.
end note

@enduml
